---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui.js';

const lang = 'en';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title="红岸三号 · Redbank III — 开源阵列望远镜" description="用消费级Sensor和开源设计,把 Dragonfly 级别的深空成像能力从 $150,000 压到 $2,000">

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-bg"><canvas id="starfield"></canvas></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">{t(lang, 'hero.eyebrow')}</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span class="line">{t(lang, 'hero.title.1')}</span>
      <span class="line">{t(lang, 'hero.title.2')}</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">{t(lang, 'hero.sub')}</p>
    <p class="hero-desc" style="white-space: pre-line">{t(lang, 'hero.desc')}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#design" class="btn btn-primary">{t(lang, 'hero.cta.design')}</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/mistyminds/redbank-iii" class="btn btn-ghost">{t(lang, 'hero.cta.github')}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">$618</div><div class="stat-label">{t(lang, 'hero.stat.cost')}</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">382mm</div><div class="stat-label">{t(lang, 'hero.stat.aperture')}</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">100×</div><div class="stat-label">{t(lang, 'hero.stat.advantage')}</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">100%</div><div class="stat-label">{t(lang, 'hero.stat.open')}</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll">Scroll down ↓</div>
</header>

<!-- ============ MISSION ============ -->
<section class="section" id="mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">MISSION · 使命</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="white-space: pre-line">{t(lang, 'mission.title')}</h2>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-text">
        <p>
          In 2013, Roberto Abraham (University of Toronto) and Pieter van Dokkum (Yale) started the <strong>Dragonfly Telephoto Array</strong> over a beer bet — eight Canon 400mm f/2.8L professional lenses networked into an array that imaged ultra-diffuse galaxies previously visible only to Hubble and Keck.
        </p>
        <p>
          But a single Dragonfly lens costs <strong>$11,500</strong> — more than most amateurs spend on astronomy in a decade. Its code is closed, its design unpublished, its replication impossible for ordinary people.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Redbank III</strong> is the opposite — consumer sensors, second-hand phones, and the Huaqiangbei supply chain, delivering equivalent aperture in a <strong>fully open source</strong> array telescope. Anyone, anywhere, can build Dragonfly-class deep-sky imaging for under $2,000.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-quote">
        <blockquote>
          "The democratization of astronomy is not building more big telescopes,<br>but making small telescopes an order of magnitude more numerous."
        </blockquote>
        <cite>— Redbank III Design Manifesto</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SCIENCE — real Hubble/JWST images ============ -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="science">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">SCIENCE TARGETS · 科学目标</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">These are within Redbank III's reach</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      The images below are from NASA/ESA/CSA's Hubble and James Webb Space Telescopes (public domain). Redbank III's 8-16 unit array can image fainter versions of these same targets — not this quality, but the same sky.
    </p>
    <div class="science-grid">
      <div class="science-card">
        <img src={`${base}/images/targets/andromeda-hst.jpg`} alt="Andromeda Galaxy (Hubble)" loading="lazy">
        <div class="science-card-overlay">
          <h3>Andromeda Galaxy M31</h3>
          <p>A 4-unit Redbank III array resolves the galactic disk and faint stellar halo. 8 units approach Dragonfly's low-surface-brightness survey depth.</p>
          <div class="credit">NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="science-card">
        <img src={`${base}/images/targets/orion-hst.jpg`} alt="Orion Nebula (Hubble)" loading="lazy">
        <div class="science-card-overlay">
          <h3>Orion Nebula M42</h3>
          <p>A single Redbank III unit captures a satisfying M42. Array stacking reveals the faint outer gas shells.</p>
          <div class="credit">NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="science-card">
        <img src={`${base}/images/targets/horsehead-hst.jpg`} alt="Horsehead Nebula (Hubble)" loading="lazy">
        <div class="science-card-overlay">
          <h3>Horsehead Nebula Barnard 33</h3>
          <p>A classic dark nebula target. Requires 8+ units and long-exposure stacking to separate from light-polluted backgrounds.</p>
          <div class="credit">NASA/ESA Hubble Space Telescope</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="science-card">
        <img src={`${base}/images/targets/pillars-hst.jpg`} alt="Pillars of Creation (Hubble)" loading="lazy">
        <div class="science-card-overlay">
          <h3>Pillars of Creation (Eagle Nebula M16)</h3>
          <p>Hubble's most iconic target. A 16-unit Redbank III array can capture the pillar structure's outline.</p>
          <div class="credit">NASA/ESA/CSA Hubble Space Telescope</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ DESIGN PHILOSOPHY ============ -->
<section class="section" id="design">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">DESIGN PHILOSOPHY · 设计哲学</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'design.title')}</h2>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle-num">I</div>
        <h3>Fully open source</h3>
        <p>Hardware CERN-OHL-W-2.0, software Apache-2.0, docs CC BY-SA 4.0. No black boxes, nothing held back. OSHWA certified.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle-num">II</div>
        <h3>Array first</h3>
        <p>Not "one good telescope" but "N cheap telescopes synthesized." Quantity over quality — the stacking algorithm is the real innovation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle-num">III</div>
        <h3>Consumer components</h3>
        <p>No scientific CCDs, no professional lenses. IMX modules, second-hand phones, Huaqiangbei supply chain — cost at 1/100.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ TWO PLANS ============ -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="plans">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">TWO PATHS · 两条路径</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'plans.title')}</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">{t(lang, 'plans.sub')}</p>

    <div class="plans-compare">
      <div class="plan-card" id="plan-a">
        <div class="plan-badge">PLAN A</div>
        <h3>IMX 模组 + RK3576 工业板</h3>
        <p class="plan-tagline">Standardized, replicable, mature ecosystem</p>
        <div class="plan-spec">
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Sensor</span><strong>IMX571 APS-C 模组</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Compute</span><strong>RK3576 工业板 (6 TOPS NPU)</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Lens</span><strong>Samyang 135mm f/2.0</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Equivalent aperture</span><strong>67.5mm (single unit)</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Cost per unit</span><strong class="cost">$1,600</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>4-unit array</span><strong>$6,400</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-pros-cons">
          <div class="pros">
            <h4>Pros</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Mature ecosystem (Linux + libcamera)</li>
              <li>Reversible assembly, low failure cost</li>
              <li>No custom mechanics required</li>
              <li>APS-C sensor (23.5×15.6mm)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="cons">
            <h4>Cons</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Higher cost ($1,600 vs $618)</li>
              <li>Requires external display/battery/storage</li>
              <li>Software stack must be written from scratch</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#bom-a" class="btn btn-plan">See Plan A BOM</a>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-card plan-featured" id="plan-b">
        <div class="plan-badge">PLAN B · 推荐</div>
        <h3>旧手机改造 + 华强北供应链</h3>
        <p class="plan-tagline">Best value — the whole software stack comes free</p>
        <div class="plan-spec">
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Platform</span><strong>Xiaomi 11 Ultra donor board</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Sensor</span><strong>1/1.12" GN2 (50MP)</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Compute/ISP</span><strong>Snapdragon 888 (free)</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Lens</span><strong>Samyang 135mm f/2.0</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Equivalent aperture</span><strong>67.5mm (single unit)</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>Cost per unit</span><strong class="cost">$618</strong></div>
          <div class="spec-row"><span>4-unit array</span><strong>$2,532</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-pros-cons">
          <div class="pros">
            <h4>Pros</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>61% cheaper ($618 vs $1,600)</li>
              <li>Free SoC + ISP + display + battery + storage</li>
              <li>Android astronomy app ecosystem ready</li>
              <li>1/1.12" sensor (larger than APS-C in area)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="cons">
            <h4>Cons</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>不可逆改装 (拆Lens组)</li>
              <li>Requires custom adapter ring</li>
              <li>Flange-distance compensation is the engineering challenge</li>
              <li>Depends on Huaqiangbei supply chain</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#bom-b" class="btn btn-plan">See Plan B BOM</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ BOM A ============ -->
<section class="section" id="bom-a">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">PLAN A · BOM</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">IMX Module Plan — Bill of Materials</h2>
    <div class="bom-table-wrap">
      <table class="bom-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Component</th><th>Model</th><th>Qty</th><th>Unit</th><th>Subtotal</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Sensor模组</td><td>Arducam IMX571 APS-C (MIPI)</td><td>1</td><td>$500</td><td>$500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Compute</td><td>RK3576 industrial board (8GB RAM)</td><td>1</td><td>$150</td><td>$150</td></tr>
          <tr><td>天文Lens</td><td>Samyang 135mm f/2.0 (Canon EF)</td><td>1</td><td>$500</td><td>$500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Peltier cooler + fan + heatsink</td><td>1</td><td>$120</td><td>$120</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Enclosure</td><td>铝合金 CNC Enclosure</td><td>1</td><td>$80</td><td>$80</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Adapter ring</td><td>Canon EF → module (custom)</td><td>1</td><td>$40</td><td>$40</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Power</td><td>12V 5A Power + 电缆</td><td>1</td><td>$40</td><td>$40</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Misc</td><td>Screws, thermal paste, seals, etc.</td><td>1</td><td>$70</td><td>$70</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Display (optional)</td><td>7" HDMI touchscreen</td><td>1</td><td>$60</td><td>$60</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Storage</td><td>256GB NVMe SSD</td><td>1</td><td>$40</td><td>$40</td></tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr class="bom-total"><td colspan="4">Total per unit</td><td><strong>$1,600</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td colspan="4">4-unit array</td><td><strong>$6,400</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td colspan="4">16-unit array</td><td><strong>$25,600</strong></td></tr>
        </tfoot>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="bom-note">
      ✅ <strong>Pros:</strong> 全部货架产品, No custom mechanics required, Linux 生态成熟<br>
      ⚠️ <strong>注意:</strong> IMX571 module needs RK3576 driver adaptation (Arducam ships RK3588 version; 3576 needs porting)
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ BOM B ============ -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="bom-b">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">PLAN B · BOM · 推荐</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Phone Conversion Plan — Bill of Materials</h2>
    <div class="bom-table-wrap">
      <table class="bom-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Component</th><th>Model / 来源</th><th>Qty</th><th>Unit</th><th>Subtotal</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Donor phone board</td><td>Xiaomi 11 Ultra (cracked screen/back, intact mainboard + camera)</td><td>1</td><td>$50</td><td>$50</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Conversion labor</td><td>华强北改机师傅 (拆Lens组 + 清洁 + 组装)</td><td>1</td><td>$3</td><td>$3</td></tr>
          <tr><td>天文Lens</td><td>Samyang 135mm f/2.0 (Canon EF)</td><td>1</td><td>$500</td><td>$500</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Adapter ring</td><td>Canon EF → 手机Sensor (CNC 定制)</td><td>1</td><td>$25</td><td>$25</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Enclosure</td><td>铝合金 CNC Enclosure (含散热)</td><td>1</td><td>$30</td><td>$30</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Focuser</td><td>M42 Focuser (天文标准件)</td><td>1</td><td>$10</td><td>$10</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Misc</td><td>Seals, IR-cut filter, screws, etc.</td><td>1</td><td>$15</td><td>$15</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Incoming QC + burn-in</td><td>Power-on test + lightbox MTF test</td><td>1</td><td>$5</td><td>$5</td></tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
          <tr class="bom-total"><td colspan="4">Total per unit</td><td><strong>$618</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td colspan="4">4-unit array</td><td><strong>$2,532</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td colspan="4">16-unit array</td><td><strong>$10,128</strong></td></tr>
        </tfoot>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="bom-note">
      ✅ <strong>Pros:</strong> 便宜 61%, Free SoC + ISP + display + battery + storage, Android 生态现成<br>
      ⚠️ <strong>注意:</strong> 不可逆改装, Depends on Huaqiangbei supply chain, Adapter ring需为每款手机定制 (建议统一用小米 11 Ultra)
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ARRAY ============ -->
<section class="section" id="array">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">ARRAY · 阵列</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'array.title')}</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">红岸三号的核心创新不在single unit, 在阵列合成。多帧叠加算法压制天空背景涨落, 这是 Dragonfly 论文里验证过的科学原理。</p>

    <div class="array-table-wrap">
      <table class="array-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Array size</th><th>Equivalent aperture</th><th>Equivalent refractor</th><th>Plan A 成本</th><th>Plan B 成本</th><th>What you can image</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>1 台</strong></td><td>67.5mm</td><td>2.7"</td><td>$1,600</td><td>$618</td><td>Moon, Jupiter, Saturn, M42, M31</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>4 台</strong></td><td>135mm</td><td>5.3"</td><td>$6,400</td><td>$2,532</td><td>+ faint galaxies, stellar halos</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>8 台</strong></td><td>191mm</td><td>7.5"</td><td>$12,800</td><td>$5,064</td><td>+ ultra-diffuse galaxies, intergalactic medium</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>16 台</strong></td><td>270mm</td><td>10.6"</td><td>$25,600</td><td>$10,128</td><td>+ Dragonfly 8-lens-class science</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>32 台</strong></td><td>382mm</td><td>15"</td><td>$51,200</td><td>$20,256</td><td>+ cosmic web, circumgalactic medium</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="array-vs">
      <h3>vs Dragonfly</h3>
      <div class="vs-grid">
        <div class="vs-item">
          <div class="vs-label">Dragonfly (8 镜)</div>
          <div class="vs-bar vs-dragonfly" style="--pct:100%">$150,000</div>
          <div class="vs-note">404mm Equivalent aperture · 闭源</div>
        </div>
        <div class="vs-item">
          <div class="vs-label">红岸 III Plan B (32 镜)</div>
          <div class="vs-bar vs-redbank" style="--pct:13.5%">$20,256</div>
          <div class="vs-note">382mm Equivalent aperture · Fully open source</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="vs-conclusion"><strong>便宜 7.4 倍, 口径接近, Fully open source。</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SOFTWARE ============ -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="software">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">SOFTWARE · Software</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'software.title')}</h2>
    <div class="software-grid">
      <div class="software-item">
        <h3>Capture</h3>
        <p>多路 MIPI 同步曝光 (Plan A) / WiFi 触发同步 (Plan B)。NTP 对时 &lt; 1ms。RAW/DNG 输出。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="software-item">
        <h3>Alignment</h3>
        <p>Inter-frame celestial alignment (astroalign / OpenCV feature matching). Sub-pixel registration. Auto boresight calibration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="software-item">
        <h3>Stacking</h3>
        <p>Sigma-clipped stacking, sky-background modeling and subtraction, dark/flat correction. Dragonfly's core science algorithm — open-sourced to its limit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="software-item">
        <h3>Control</h3>
        <p>Mount control (INDI / LX200), automated survey, target scheduling. Native Octos AgentOS integration — telescope as agent, auto-responding to GRB/SN alerts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STORY ============ -->
<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">STORY · 故事</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'story.title')}</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">2013</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3>Dragonfly is born</h3>
          <p>Abraham 和 van Dokkum 用一个啤酒赌注开始 Dragonfly — 8 颗 Canon 400mm f/2.8L Lens, single unit $11,500。拍到了超暗弱星系, 改变了低面亮度天文学。但代码不开源, 设计不公开。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">2021</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3>MOTHRA launches</h3>
          <p>Dragonfly 团队获得 XTX Markets 创始人 Alex Gerko 的 FRO 资助, 开始 MOTHRA — 1140 颗Lens的超级阵列。成本数千万美元, 依然闭源。大科学的路径越走越远。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-year">2024</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3>Open robotics paradigm matures</h3>
          <p>reBot-DevArm, Reachy Mini, and Open Duck Mini proved the mature open-hardware model: CERN-OHL + Apache-2.0 dual licensing, public BOM, Huaqiangbei supply chain, Discord community, tiered SKUs. That paradigm transfers to astronomy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item timeline-now">
        <div class="timeline-year">2025</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3>Redbank III launches</h3>
          <p>我们把 Dragonfly 的科学思路 + 开源机器人的工程范式 + 华强北的供应链能力结合起来。Plan A (IMX 模组) 走标准化路线, Plan B (旧手机改造) 走极致性价比路线。Fully open source, 任何人都能造。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item timeline-future">
        <div class="timeline-year">未来</div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <h3>Global distributed array</h3>
          <p>1000 个红岸三号节点分布在全球, 通过 Octos AgentOS 统一调度, 形成一个Equivalent aperture超过任何单一望远镜的虚拟阵列。这是天文学的真正民主化。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ OPEN SOURCE ============ -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="open">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE · 开源</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">{t(lang, 'open.title')}</h2>
    <div class="open-grid">
      <div class="open-item">
        <h3>Hardware</h3>
        <div class="license-badge">CERN-OHL-W-2.0</div>
        <p>CAD 图纸, BOM, Adapter ring设计, Enclosure 3D 模型, 全部开源。OSHWA 认证。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="open-item">
        <h3>Software</h3>
        <div class="license-badge">Apache-2.0</div>
        <p>Capture, alignment, stacking, control — all open. Commercial use, modification, redistribution allowed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="open-item">
        <h3>Docs</h3>
        <div class="license-badge">CC BY-SA 4.0</div>
        <p>Assembly tutorials, debugging guides, science cases — all open. Translations welcome.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="open-item">
        <h3>Data</h3>
        <div class="license-badge">CC0</div>
        <p>原始 FITS 帧, 叠加结果, 巡天Data, 全部发布到 Hugging Face。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="open-cta">
